  "description": "Start your BMX journey the right way with the Revo line. Built to deliver an authentic freestyle riding experience, the Revo combines durability, performance, and incredible value in one complete package. Every component has been carefully selected to ensure the bike is ready to shred straight out of the box, easy to maintain, and upgradeable as your skills progress. Loaded with features like 25-9 gearing, tapered fork legs, and short, responsive pro-inspired geometry, the Revo is designed to help riders progress faster and have more fun doing it.\nReady to step up your BMX journey? The Revo 18\"\" PRO builds on the solid foundation of the Revo 18\"\" with the addition of a 3-piece crank upgrade, delivering a stronger, more dialled setup for riders pushing their skills to the next level. Combining pro-inspired performance with incredible value, it's built to inspire confidence from the very first session.\"\n\nBRAKE: RADIO “AM” caliper brake, alloy, front / RADIO “AM-U” u-brake, alloy, rear",
